 "notes": "The Juno-106 as its owner’s manual describes it. DCO: saw and pulse together, range (-1 16’, 0 8’, 1 4’), pwm lfo (0 MAN: pw is the width, 1 LFO: pwm the depth). HPF 1..3 on hpf, 0 on bass boost. A 24 dB low pass per voice; env, polarity, lfo, kybd in octaves. VCA by env or gate. LFO delay. Bender: dco bend, vcf bend (octaves), the lever’s LFO on the mod wheel. Portamento. Assign: rotate Poly 1, lowest Poly 2, unison solo. Transpose (0.08 a semitone), tune, hold. Six voices, chorus."
}
